.TH SWAYDESK-WEATHER 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.3" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-weather \- weather for Waybar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-weather
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints one Waybar line with the current weather, from wttr.in, and exits. Waybar runs it every minute; the forecast is cached, so most runs do not reach the network.
.PP
The session runs it under the name waybar\-weather\-bar (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-weather); the process name is waybar\-weather\-bar too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sway\-desktop/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/waybar\-weather.json
The cached forecast, shared with the popup.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7),
.BR swaydesk\-weather\-popup (1),
.BR waybar (5)
